l\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:11.25pt;background:#1c1c1c;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(230,225,220);border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0cm\">sigma   log 4.504631e+03 5.528997e+02 3.544646e+03\r\n5.724607e+03</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#e6e1dc\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">As you can see from the summary, the D estimate is 0.000517\r\nindividuals per hectare which gives a population size for the entire park ~ 36\r\nelephants. </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can anybody suggest where I am going wrong? Any help would\r\nbe greatly appreciated.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks in advance</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Jacqui<span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:107%\"></span></p></div></blockquote></div>"
